  #****************************************************
  # description       :   interface for uGo
  # version:      	:   6.0
  # created           :   21.04.2022
  # updated           :
  #****************************************************
  # modifications     :   add new rpc-functions to interchange more data
  #
  # date              :   2024-02-29
  # name              :   P. Koehnke
  # reason            :   implemtentation of PackML behavoiur in uGO
  #****************************************************
  #****************************************************
  # modifications     :   add reflecting the UID of the uGO task back to uGO
  #
  # date              :   2024-07-02
